		{"id":"7b7c9aebbba3957c","type":"text","text":" Seat","x":-86,"y":-653,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"44f62e5d90050580","type":"text","text":"本座约定为中国则仲裁为中国（采仲裁地说）","x":229,"y":-655,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ea22442fb7ecc335","type":"text","text":"eg. HK apply ICC rules --> BJ(the seat)","x":565,"y":-657,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"cbcb1e52ec14e9f7","type":"text","text":"NY Convention applies to HK, HOW?","x":914,"y":-800,"width":370,"height":50},
		{"id":"0a666b82344adceb","type":"text","text":"(h) Upon resumption of sovereignty over Hong Kong on 1 July 1997, the Government of China extended the territorial application of the Convention to Hong Kong, Special Administrative Region of China, subject to the statement originally made by China upon accession to the Convention. On 19 July 2005, China declared that the Convention shall apply to the Macao Special Administrative Region of China, subject to the statement originally made by China upon accession to the Convention[status,uncitral]","x":1172,"y":-720,"width":861,"height":143},
		{"id":"f639f9bbdbf3baea","type":"text","text":"rules shall be applied in such order: IIC--> Court(仲裁庭)","x":975,"y":-893,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"df7df034bd64f436","type":"text","text":"Arbitration","x":-440,"y":-255,"width":133,"height":60},
		{"id":"4729421953a0658d","type":"text","text":"ad hoc arbitration","x":-841,"y":-255,"width":183,"height":61},
		{"id":"ea7daf9f2aeb1c98","type":"text","text":"有限度开放；面向有限争议","x":-999,"y":-180,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5a0b3d166e7e515e","type":"text","text":"no permanent institution","x":-1240,"y":-335,"width":216,"height":50},
		{"id":"953e4934295dceed","type":"text","text":"more flexible rules","x":-1240,"y":-250,"width":176,"height":50},
		{"id":"3e2454a20f8b422d","type":"text","text":" 中国的临时仲裁","x":-1240,"y":-169,"width":176,"height":50},
		{"id":"0108dc2e8f936028","type":"text","text":" confidentiality","x":-335,"y":87,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3af002b4ce4a05d0","type":"text","text":" 思考：主权国家进行非主权行为（商业）中是否应当缓和仲裁的保密性","x":-334,"y":192,"width":250,"height":115},
		{"id":"b50ef2c002a31b1a","type":"text","text":"如何撰写仲裁条款","x":-498,"y":-508,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7f6eddde7ce4bedf","type":"text","text":"事项是否适于仲裁","x":-823,"y":-512,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"962c55bf3db6177d","x":3,"y":-775,"width":73,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"属籍"},
		{"id":"09f7f2aa1c338741","type":"text","text":"Content","x":-1339,"y":36,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"efb7efbf68387f88","type":"text","text":"没有超裁的部分当然执行","x":-1024,"y":146,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ffc397aeb8fc6986","type":"text","text":" 超裁之后怎样：撤销/不予执行后，可以重新仲裁/起诉","x":-1339,"y":147,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"eaa1d71b562df82a","type":"text","text":"对抗性","x":-1288,"y":304,"width":250,"height":60},
